--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_04_SalesTrust
  questionId: CTX-04
  category: 0
  speakerName: Hiring Manager
  questionText: >-
    The customer says their security team does not trust salespeople. The room goes quiet. What is your response?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_04_A1
  answerText: >-
    Say that is fair, then define what evidence they should expect before trusting any claim.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 3
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_04_A2
  answerText: >-
    Make a light comment and move to the customer logo slide.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_04_A3
  answerText: >-
    Push back that your role is technical enough for the discussion.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_CTX_04_A4
  answerText: >-
    Ask what previous vendors overclaimed, then set boundaries for what you can prove today.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 0
